source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: The brace form applies inside a heading.
-- input.jira --
h1. a{*}b{*}c
-- rendered.html --
<h1><a name="a%7B%7Db%7B%7Dc"></a>a<b>b</b>c</h1>
-- want.md --
# a**b**c
-- warnings.json --
[]
